{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 源动画曲线｜结构与唯一状态归属\n箭头标明调用/持有/数据；Animation仅发布元数据，CMC owns motion clock/请求/胶囊。\n[[Animation/曲线处理|算法与边界]] · [[Animation/结构|Animation]] · [[Movement/结构|Movement]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|流程图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3660,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## MovementSet：模式/数值配置\nSetMovementSet/ValidateMovementSet验证明确Fixed/曲线模式与参数。\n曲线模式不再要求七Profile；默认Set七废弃引用null、原十九参数bit保持。\nActionMotionProfile归独立动作链。\n七Locomotion DA已删除；不得作运行兜底。\n[[Movement/结构|配置归属]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 580,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Animation：发布配置＋只读抓帧\nZZZ.ResolveLocomotionSourceBinding解析本人AnimSet；Base在原Native生命周期发布原身份/metadata。\nPublish(binding,error)接收Missing/Invalid状态，必需曲线执行时由CMC拒绝；Fixed/GA不误报。\nUninitialize/Owner/config退出→Retire(originalProducer,originalConfigGeneration)，仅撤原代次。\nStateCapture读当时CMC/ASC/Pawn，Frame给ABP语义，CurveMotion入Debug。\n无Graph曲线反读、求值器或motion clock。\n[[Animation/结构|生命周期与接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "sampler",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 历史Sampler（无生产边）\nFGGYGOAnimCurveSampler仍在源码，CMC无调用。\n旧GetCurveValue/Cfg来源猜测、跨帧累计Pos/Yaw差分、非有限归零/缺方向替代不是当前契约。\nFGGYGOAnimCurveMotion只是sample兼容别名。\n不恢复旧业务兜底。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#7. 历史Sampler与Editor读回边界|历史]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2880,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 610,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "motion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 区间样本（CMC owns）\nFGGYGOLocomotionCurveSample：Speed/Velocity/Direction、YawDelta/Total、source/loop标志。\n单段端点Speed乘真实time rate；WalkRun V=sum(w*源V)，混合速度=|V|。\n有限非零Dir不被epsilon截零；正Speed单源须方向，混合抵消为零合法。\n合法0/极小值/0Scale保留来源；PositionDelta不生成。\n样本是区间派生结果，只有CMC Commit/Consume提交；无第二clock。\nRMS仅消费原Prepared。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#4. 速度、Yaw与原生RMS消费|速度与退出]]",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 720,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CMC｜唯一时钟/请求/胶囊\n公开Publish/Retire接收原source配置；GetBinding/Validate重验原身份与状态。\nBefore候选按motion/cycle/alpha调用纯源重载；成功才Commit，失败Reject原请求。\nStop/TurnBack Stage暂存原binding/Input/Origin并挂源，等待实际Prepare；Completed仅续剩余clip。\nPrepare按原关系和实际区间求值；正常一次Consume，回放Before消费。\nauthority保留原合法binding/native interval，清旧派生Prepared并重算，不借旧结果覆盖校正。\nCMC唯一提交time/cycle/phase/CurveMotion；RMS只供速度，CMC/原生物理移动胶囊。\nFixed正常，Missing/Invalid/Stale不兜底。\n[[Movement/结构|实际接口]]",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "rms",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Curve RMS｜执行贡献\n持原Origin/binding；Clone保留引用，不认证同名/LocalID。\nPrepareRootMotion(actual sim,tick)→原CMC.PrepareLocomotionCurveRootMotion。\n返回Prepared/Finished/Stale/Failed/UnsupportedOrigin；只写返回世界速度与native EndTime。\n端点速度×sim/tick经BaseYaw转换，非精确位移积分。\nStop实际源Speed=0可自然结束；TurnBack按既定phase/段语义退出。mixed zero不结束其它资源。\n失败仅报告仍匹配原请求，旧源只退自身。\nNetSerialize加载清本地Origin/Prepared；外来Origin认证未支持。",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 750,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SavedMove｜原source与实际区间\nSetMoveFor保存原binding与普通time/cycle/alpha/段/转身基线；不同publication不合并。\nPostUpdate另存原Input/Prepared/Pending，均为有界派生引用。\nPrepMoveFor先安装原binding/Input/Source group，再native Super；Finish清借用组。\n普通replay按原上下文消费；缺原准备区间不造整帧dt。\nauthority清旧派生Prepared，用原合法binding及native interval沿新基线重算。\nFAILED不重开、旧binding不授权后继；Clear/EndReplay/EndPlay清本人引用。\nMoveData仍hint，导入Origin/完整网络未验。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#5. 预测恢复与Animation只读Capture|重演契约]]",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 2880,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 830,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Source binding（不可变元数据）\nFGGYGOLocomotionSourceBinding\nIdentity：weak原Producer/Character/Mesh＋生命周期/config代次。\nStatus/Error；五单段Source；实际WalkRun BS与sample descriptor。\nStrong资产refs，loop、SequenceRateScale、SampleRateScale、PlayLength/样本位置。\n当前binding和既有有界move记录保留；引用不是执行准入。\nGetSingleSource(MotionType)/GetWalkRunSample(index)只读查询。\n无曲线副本、Graph输出、move时钟；旧DA不在本节点。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#1. 当前职责与依赖方向|发布/退休]]",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 780,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 当前证据/剩余边界\nSource6b7361d已push，Gate91编译exit0。\n必要四烟3Success/1Fail；FailedRequestRecovery原两配置Error与请求3恢复标记仍Fail，未改绿。\n三DirX键精确修正并fresh冷读；其它约定字段保持，raw骨键/Channel未验。\n七旧DA已解绑/删除/fresh Registry及cold Set验证；强source引用不复制曲线。\nABP FullBody Gate82已保存；Player/Evaluator相位未迁，不承诺视觉同clock。\n真实Run/生产Stop、DS/网络/首帧/partial/catchup/后继隔离与PlayerCombo位移仍未验。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#6. 当前失败消费缺口与实施状态|证据范围]]",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 2880,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 930,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Movement纯源求值\nValidateSource/ValidateBinding→明确源/曲线/原metadata验证。\nEvaluateSingleInterval(Source,t0,t1,Scale)。\nEvaluateWalkRunInterval(Binding,cycle,dt,alpha,Scale)：实际BS权重/native period→各源速度向量后混合。\nEvaluateCurveData读取源，合法mixed zero成功。\n返回Sample/Scaled结果与数学末相位，不写clock/请求/Graph缓存。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#2. 源动画数据与区间求值契约|算法]]",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-readers",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Editor读取器（工具值副本）\nReadFloatCurves→完整公开DataModel曲线/源double时长。\nReadFloatCurveSnapshot→调用一次R1，输出Name/Flags/Default/外推/九键字段等同步副本。\n副本归调用者，无运行source handle/clock/缓存。\n用于明确源诊断与冷读；不成为CMC输入或新曲线DA。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#7. 历史Sampler与Editor读回边界|读取边界]]",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "editor-profile-author",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 历史独立Profile作者（退出生产）\nCreateOrInspectProfile(Source,Path,Snapshot,Target,Duration,Loop)。\n重新R1比较源，整FRichCurve复制，不重算切线；ExistingMatched只读，CreatedUnsaved由调用者精确保存。\n类/作者/旧求值重载与失败证据保留；无边进入CMC生产链。\n2026-10-04七DA生成/接线为历史，七生产盘包现已删除。\n不自动恢复副本或用它补缺源。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#8. Editor单Profile作者与保存边界|历史/退役]]",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 800,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-editing",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 当前源动画唯一编辑\nSpeed/DirX/DirY/Yaw保存在Sequence。\n生成器保留有限非零方向与速度；只压真正恒定序列。\nRun_End83/99、Walk_End151仅DirX现键0→1，精确保存/fresh冷读。\n其它约定字段保持；raw骨键/Channel未验。",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 2600,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 470,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile-retirement",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 七旧Locomotion DA已退役\n八包备份→Set七引用null/十九参数bit保持→Registry incoming空。\nCLI退出后离线删除七包，fresh Registry目标/依赖节点不存在。\ncold Set/源包/备份保持，dirty=[]。\n独立ActionMotionProfile归动作链；不证明Run/网络。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#8. Editor单Profile作者与保存边界|证据]]",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 3300,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
